            "@type": "Answer",
            "text": "The certified ones do what their data sheet says, at the rated flow and capacity. The PUR PLUS cartridge, for example, is certified by IAPMO R&amp;T to NSF/ANSI 42, 53 and 401, with lead reduction of 99.6 to 99.7% and total PFAS of 99.92% on its data sheet. A filter with only NSF/ANSI 42 is certified for chlorine taste and odor, not health contaminants."
