            Finally, note the time limits. Both PUR and Brita give a calendar limit as well as a gallon limit, and you should change the cartridge at whichever comes first. A carbon block sitting wet for months can grow bacteria on its surface, even if it has not reached its gallon rating. If your housing has a filter-life indicator, trust it over memory; if it does not, write the install date on the housing with a marker.
